msgid "内核内部接口"
msgstr "Internal kernel interfaces"

msgid ""
"按职责组织的内核部件可以内置，具有独立生命周期的部件也可加载为原生 ``.ko``。内核私有接口随精确构建 ABI 绑定，不属于稳定 UAPI。"
msgstr ""
"Kernel components organized by responsibility can be built in; components "
"with an independent lifecycle can also be loaded as native ``.ko`` modules. "
"Private kernel interfaces are tied to the exact build ABI and are not part "
"of the stable UAPI."
